Radioify for Windows
====================

This bundle contains a prebuilt Windows x64 copy of Radioify.

Install on this PC:
- Double-click install_radioify.cmd
- Or run install_radioify.ps1 from PowerShell

Portable use:
- Run radioify.exe directly from the extracted folder

What the installer does:
- Installs the full MSIX package that owns Radioify, file associations, and
  Explorer integration

Notes:
- Installing may trigger a UAC prompt to trust the development certificate
- The extracted bundle contains the signed .msix and its certificate at the
  bundle root. Manifest inputs stay under win11-explorer-integration.
- PSF2 playback still needs hebios.bin supplied separately
- Automatic video chapters require compatible D3D11VA and Vulkan hardware.
  Built with Llama.
  Runtime analysis currently supports videos from 30 seconds through 60
  minutes; longer sources are rejected instead of silently reducing evidence
  density below the validated cadence.
  Vulkan inference runs in an isolated helper process so foreground playback
  can reclaim GPU resources without waiting for a model dispatch to cooperate.
  Open Chapters during playback to explicitly install the pinned Qwen2.5-VL
  observer and Chapter-Llama planner base; the bundle does not contain or
  silently download either model. Radioify ships only the verified
  Chapter-Llama planner adapter and its provenance notice.
  Model sources and licenses:
  https://huggingface.co/ggml-org/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct-GGUF
  https://huggingface.co/lucas-ventura/chapter-llama
  Llama 3.1 license: models\chapter_analysis\LLAMA-3.1-LICENSE
  Acceptable Use Policy: https://llama.meta.com/llama3_1/use-policy
